                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "action",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "You should <w>structure</w> your essay clearly before you start writing the details.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Вам следует чётко <w>структурировать</w> эссе, прежде чем начинать расписывать детали.",
                                "tr": "Detayları yazmaya başlamadan önce makalenizi net bir şekilde <w>yapılandırmalısınız</w>.",
                                "pl": "Powinieneś wyraźnie <w>ustrukturyzować</w> swój esej, zanim zaczniesz opisywać szczegóły.",
                                "zh": "在开始撰写细节之前，你应该清晰地<w>规划</w>你的文章结构。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The loan was <w>structured</w> to allow for flexible monthly repayments.",
